    "serverInfo": {
     "name": "todaytix",
     "title": "TodayTix",
     "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "instructions": "Help fans find live theatre and events on TodayTix and book them. Recommend shows from list_shows, and look up seats only for shows the fan is interested in rather than pricing every candidate. When the fan hasn't named a city, leave location out. If TodayTix can tell where the fan is, it uses the nearest city and names it on every result, so say which city you searched and offer to look elsewhere. If it cannot tell, the tool says so: only then ask which city the fan means. Tools that take a showId use the show's own market when no location is given."
   }
